define phrase fiona-no-time
  Fiona holds up her hand. 'There is no time, Jacqueline,' she says gently.
  'You need to get going.'
end phrase

define phrase fiona-things-to-know
  Fiona puts a hand on your arm. 'Wait, Jacqueline. There are things you need
  to know before you leave.'
end phrase

